aks3 is an S3-compatible object storage server written in Rust.

The design of its storage engine is derived from MinIO
(https://github.com/minio/minio), Copyright MinIO, Inc., licensed under
the GNU AGPL v3.0: the on-disk layout, the write discipline that
publishes an object, and the locking model. Later work is expected to
derive from the same source, and this notice will be extended as it does.
